<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30074" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκαθ-ίζω</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκαθ-κατίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>seat in</i> or <i>upon</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς θρόνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					553c
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. στρατιὰν ἐν τοῖς τόποις</span>
			<i>station</i> a force <i>in</i> a place, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				16.37.4
			</span></i>: aor. 1
			
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναὸν ἐγκαθείσατο</span>
			(vulg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκαθείσατο</span>, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκαθισάμενοι τὰ ὅπλα</span>
			v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				5.1.2
			</span></i>) <i>founded</i> a temple <i>there</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				31
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>administer a sitz-bath to</i> one, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.64
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Herod.Med.
			</span></i> ap.<i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				6.20.18
			</span></i>, etc.:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				1.35
			</span></i>; also, <i>to be used for such</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.13
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				30
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>cause to subside upon</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς κοιλώμασι τὴν ὑπερκειμένην γῆν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyd.
					<u>Ost.</u>
					53
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>sit in</i> or <i>upon</i>, [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θρόνῳ</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				4.153
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκατίζεσθαι εἰς θρόνον</span>
			<i>take one's seat</i> on . . , <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.26
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
